      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $A$ below. Which set of entries should be replaced by $0$ to obtain row echelon form **using the fewest replacements**? Leave all other entries unchanged.\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -4 & 3 & -7 \\\\ -2 & -7 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 8 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 8 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
